Package: photobleach
Type: Package
Title: Count Photobleaching Steps in Single-Molecule Fluorescence Trajectories
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bingzhi", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your.email@example.com"),
    person("Konstantinos", "Tsekouras", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "original mSIC step-finding code (2015)"),
    person("Sina", "Jazani", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "original mSIC step-finding code (2015)"))
Description: Counts how many fluorescent molecules sit in a diffraction-limited
    spot by finding the photobleaching steps in its intensity trace. Implements the
    Bayesian step-finding method of Tsekouras et al. (2016) <doi:10.1091/mbc.E16-06-0404>,
    which scores step arrangements with a modified Schwarz Information Criterion,
    in a fast vectorised form for batch analysis of many trajectories, with
    interactive (click-based) setting of the priors.
